About ABC Tech

ABC Tech is an innovative technology company based in Bengaluru focused on delivering web and mobile solutions for clients across industries. We work with modern technologies to build high-quality software products. Visit us at: https://abctech.com/

Internship Overview

We are looking for a talented and motivated Full Stack Developer Intern to join our development team for a 2-month internship program. During this period, you will work on real projects with guidance from experienced developers. Candidates who demonstrate strong performance will be offered a full-time position at ABC Tech after the internship.

This opportunity is ideal for fresh graduates or final-year students who are eager to learn and grow in a professional environment.

